+## Run it
+
+```bash
+cd apps/swarm-ui && npm ci && npx vite --port 5173   # fixtures: the dev build with no VITE_LIVE (api.ts USE_FIXTURES)
+```
+
+Open the screen's path with the switches. The router drops any query it does not know on its first render, so the
+switches are read ONCE at module load (`switches.ts`) and kept for the page's life; a navigation inside the console
+keeps them, a reload needs them in the address again.
+
