+| `?pa=` | `base`, `a`, `b` | the direction. With no `pa` the console draws itself unchanged. `a` and `b` draw the base layout until their steps replace `PluginsConsole.tsx`'s switch |
+| `?ps=` | `config`, `builder`, `plan`, `needs` | the screen (default `config`) |
