+| `designerInterview('open' \| 'answered')` | **served** core: `GET /v1/tasks/{id}/questions` on a bridged wait (`_serve_wait`); plus NOT SERVED `skill`, `previews`, `interview` | step `roombook-checkout-redesign`, question 13 with 4 options, recommended first, HTML preview each; 12 answered (6 in the console, 5 in Voice it, 1 in Claude Code) |
+| `Q13`, `Q13_OPTIONS`, `designerTask` | | the hard case's question and its step |
